      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive veterinary doctors and welcoming staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A large majority of pet owners praise the compassionate approach of veterinarians and technicians, noting practitioners like Dr. Nicole and Dr. B for thorough diagnostic work and reassuring consultations. A few clients reported isolated frustrations with specific relief doctors, but overall feedback highlights thoughtful care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Dependable general medicine with imaging gaps"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet parents report dependable treatment outcomes for ailments ranging from minor ear infections to complex surgeries. However, sentiment is mixed due to a few reports of scheduling mix-ups with outside ultrasound technicians and delayed cone distribution following routine spay procedures."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Transparent fees compared to specialty hospitals"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients appreciate reasonable pricing for routine examinations, lab tests, and urgent care treatments. Pet owners note that fees remain transparent and substantially lower than large specialty emergency centers, making unexpected medical treatments manageable for families."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
